flowchart TD
    T[Trigger: user / schedule / event] --> CB[Context Builder]
    CB --> SR[Skill Registry]
    SR --> LP[Loop Planner]
    LP --> L1[Execution Lane]
    LP --> L2[Optional Parallel Lane]

    L1 --> TK[Guardian Trust Kernel]
    L2 --> TK
    TK -->|Denied / Approval Needed| H[Human Approval or Escalation]
    TK -->|Authorized| BR[Connector Broker]
    BR --> C[Sandboxed Connector]
    C --> A[External or Simulated Action]
    A --> V[Independent Verifier]

    V -->|Pass| MW[Governed Memory Writeback]
    MW --> AU[Append-only Audit Trail]
    V -->|Fail + retries remain| RP[Repair Planner]
    RP --> TK
    V -->|Fail / risk increased / retry exhausted| H
    H --> AU

    SM[Emergency Safe Mode] -. overrides .-> TK
    SM -. stops .-> BR
    SM -. stops .-> L1
    SM -. stops .-> L2
